                " ",
                {
                  "tag": "p",
                  "props": {
                    "className": "lang-en"
                  },
                  "children": [
                    " Located near Junnar in the Pune district, Shivneri is revered as the birthplace of Chhatrapati Shivaji Maharaj. It is a formidable fortress featuring steep rock faces and seven massive successive gates designed to halt invading armies. "
                  ]
                },
                " ",
                {
                  "tag": "p",
                  "props": {
                    "className": "lang-en"
                  },
                  "children": [
                    " On February 19, 1630, a legend was born within its secure walls. Inside the fort is the ",
                    {
                      "tag": "strong",
                      "props": {},
                      "children": [
                        "Shivai Temple"
                      ]
                    },
                    ", dedicated to the Goddess Shivai, after whom Jijabai named her illustrious son. The fort remains a sacred pilgrimage site for millions who draw inspiration from Maharaj's beginnings. "
                  ]
                },
                " ",
                {
                  "tag": "p",
                  "props": {
                    "className": "lang-mr-text deva-body"
                  },
                  "children": [
                    " पुणे जिल्ह्यातील जुन्नर जवळ वसलेला शिवनेरी किल्ला म्हणजे छत्रपती शिवाजी महाराजांचे जन्मस्थान. उंच कडे आणि सलग सात प्रवेशद्वारे यामुळे हा किल्ला शत्रूंसाठी अभेद्य मानला जात असे. "
                  ]
                },
                " ",
                {
                  "tag": "p",
                  "props": {
                    "className": "lang-mr-text deva-body"
                  },
                  "children": [
                    " १९ फेब्रुवारी १६३० रोजी याच गडावर महाराजांचा जन्म झाला. गडावरील ",
                    {
                      "tag": "strong",
                      "props": {},
                      "children": [
                        "शिवाई देवीच्या मंदिरात"
                      ]
                    },
                    " जिजाबाईंनी देवीला साकडे घातले होते आणि म्हणूनच त्यांनी आपल्या पुत्राचे नाव 'शिवाजी' ठेवले. शिवनेरी हे आज प्रत्येक शिवभक्ताचे एक पवित्र तीर्थस्थान बनले आहे. "
                  ]
                },
